# Mentor (CR 702.134a, 115.1): "target attacking creature with lesser power" - equal power is not lesser. Sunhome Stalwart (2/2)
# attacks with Isamaru (2/2): the only other attacker has equal power, so the ability has no legal target and is not put on the
# stack, and Isamaru gets no counter. (The scenarios of the other mentor cards are the positive control: a 1/1 attacking with a
# 2-power mentor does get one.) Black Lotus (three white) pays for both.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Sunhome Stalwart
Isamaru, Hound of Konda
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Sunhome Stalwart.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Sunhome Stalwart > Bot2; Isamaru, Hound of Konda > Bot2)
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot2.Life = 16
